# Project Context
You are working in the moduai-pr project - AI presentation site, challenger staff progress, YouTube, and various dynamic activity connections.
The project follows Korean documentation standards and all responses should be in Korean.

# Rules Hierarchy
1. AGENTS.md (Root Rule) - 최상위 절대 규칙
2. docs/rule/*.md - 실무 세부 규칙
3. This .clinerules file - 프로젝트 특화 규칙

# Key Directives
- 모든 답변, 코드 주석, 문서는 한글로 작성한다 (AGENTS.md §1.1)
- 소스 코드 최상단에 파일 상대경로를 주석으로 명시한다 (AGENTS.md §1.1) - .ps1/.cmd 포함
- JSDoc 주석은 한글로 작성한다
- ESM/TypeScript 규격(import/export)은 하위 프로젝트 코드에 준용한다

# Project Structure
- moduai-pr 루트(저장소 기준): AI 프리젠테이션 사이트·도전자 스탭·활동 내역 관리
- 멀티미디어 콘텐츠 focus: YouTube 동영상, 프레젠테이션 자료 관리
- AI 도구 로컬 격리: .cline/, .opencode/, .qwen/, .vibe/, .codex/

# Important Files
- AGENTS.md: 최상위 규칙
- docs/rule/R-00000 instructions.md: 규칙 인덱스
- docs/rule/R-00100 architecture.md: 아키텍처
- docs/rule/R-00101 tech-stack.md: 기술 스택
- docs/rule/R-00106 coding.md: 코딩 표준
- docs/rule/R-00109 ai-agent-local-config.md: AI 에이전트 로컬 운영 규격

# Security Rules
- Path validation is required for all file operations
- PowerShell escape handling for Windows environments
- No sensitive data in logs (API keys, tokens, secrets)
- All AI agent operations must follow AGENTS.md §1.3 recording obligations
- Project-local configuration only; never touch global/user-home settings

# Workflow Management
- Record all requests in docs/ask.md
- Create execution plans in docs/todo.md
- Archive completed work in docs/todo.history.md and docs/askLogs/
- Maintain change history in docs/CHANGELOG/

# Communication
- 하위 프로젝트 전담 작업 이력은 해당 프로젝트의 docs/ 하위에 기록한다 (AGENTS.md §1.3 예외)
- 에이전트 간 작업 조율은 docs/todo.md를 통해 이뤄진다 (R-00105)

# Environment Management
- Run via scripts/run-cline.ps1 launcher (project-local .cline/ isolation)
- API keys stored in .env files (gitignored)
- Environment variables injected via PowerShell scripts
- Never use global AI CLI installations

# Do Not
- Do not modify global settings
- Do not write to user home directories
- Do not commit API keys or secrets
- Do not use force push without explicit approval
- Do not modify files without reading them first
- Do not modify .opencode/, .vibe/, .codex/ local settings of other agents

# Remember
- Always verify: JSON parses, tests pass, code runs, expected output produced
- Stop when stuck: re-read files, ask one concrete question
- Minimal changes: only touch what was requested
- Write comprehensive tests for new features